---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="About — Alexander" description="About Alexander.">
	<section class="mx-auto max-w-3xl px-6 py-16">
		<h1 class="text-3xl font-bold">About Me</h1>
		<p class="mt-4 text-text-muted">
			I'm a recent graduate taking a gap year to build backend systems. I'd rather spend that
			time getting properly technical with system architecture than divide my attention
			between job hunting and learning.
		</p>

		<p class="mt-4 text-text-muted">
		    My main project is <a
				href="/projects/aether-ml"
				class="font-semibold text-accent underline hover:text-accent-hover"
				>Aether-ML</a> — a deep learning framework
			I built from scratch, with JIT-compiled kernels for both CUDA and ROCm/HIP and branch
			conditionals resolved ahead of time rather than at runtime.
		</p>
		<h2 class="mt-12 text-2xl font-semibold">Hobbies</h2>

		<p class="mt-4 text-text-muted">
		    Outside of software I train (currently PPL UL) and build PCs. I've also spent far too many hours
			ricing my Linux desktop with Hyprland, where a working setup is always one animation curve
			away from a rewrite.
		</p>
	</section>
</Layout>
